      "short_description": "Sophisticated casino resort with upscale rooms, multiple dining options, outdoor pools, spa, concert theater, and 24-hour casino near Palm Springs.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": null,
      "overall_description": "Agua Caliente Resort Casino Spa Rancho Mirage is a premier desert destination that combines the excitement of a 24-hour casino with the relaxation of a four-star resort. The property features luxurious accommodations, an array of dining options including a renowned high-end steakhouse, and a world-class concert theater that attracts top-tier talent. With its convenient freeway-adjacent location, impeccable service, and well-maintained spa and pool facilities, it serves as an ideal hub for both leisure travelers and those looking for a vibrant escape in the Coachella Valley.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is generally perceived as sophisticated and polished, characterized by well-kept facilities and a vibrant energy that shifts seamlessly from tranquil spa and pool areas to the lively buzz of the casino floor.",
      "amenities_description": "Agua Caliente Resort Casino Spa Rancho Mirage is a sophisticated destination offering upscale rooms, a full-service casino with table games and slots, and a world-class concert venue called The Show. The resort features extensive dining, including a fine-dining steakhouse, a cafe, and a sports bar. Guests have access to an outdoor pool with cabana rentals, a professional spa offering massages and beauty treatments, a fitness center, and a business center with versatile meeting spaces. The property is known for its professional staff, clean environment, and convenient location with complimentary parking and valet services.",
      "unique_selling_points": "The resort is home to an opera-style concert venue with excellent sightlines and hosts a premium steakhouse known for its high-end culinary experience. Its location offers a perfect balance of resort-style luxury and 24-hour casino excitement directly off the main regional highway.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The surrounding area serves as a primary hub for desert travelers, offering a convenient stop-off point that is both accessible and well-connected to regional attractions.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Situated in the desert landscape near Palm Springs, this property is prominently located right off the main freeway for easy access. The environment balances expansive desert views with a contained, well-maintained resort complex.",
